<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15">
  <head>
    <metadata>
      <ttm:title>Marble Floors</ttm:title>
      <ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Summrs</ttm:agent>
      <ttm:item type="album">Marble Floors</ttm:item>
      <ttm:item type="spotify_id">30S82dxldXsPbuj4ShyVBK</ttm:item>
    </metadata>
    <styling>
      <style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold"/>
      <style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic"/>
    </styling>
    <layout>
      <region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center"/>
    </layout>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.000" end="00:08.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yeah, it's that Really Rich shit, nigga)</p>
      <p begin="00:08.894" end="00:12.260" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(It's that double R, bird business shit)</p>
      <p begin="00:12.260" end="00:17.864" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I got rich off and I cut everybody off, **** 'em)</p>
      <p begin="00:17.864" end="00:22.035" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(It's that bird business shit, it's ****in' global)</p>
      <p begin="00:22.035" end="00:28.314" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I love you, I love you too, ha-ha)</p>
      <p begin="00:28.314" end="00:29.814" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:28.565" end="00:32.200" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Cleanin' my car in the rain (In the rain, nigga)</p>
      <p begin="00:32.200" end="00:35.287" ttm:agent="v1">Nigga can't ask me for shit, you know they ain't hittin' my mother****in' drank</p>
      <p begin="00:35.287" end="00:37.311" ttm:agent="v1">Fifties look like my cup, it's pink, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:37.311" end="00:38.840" ttm:agent="v1">Go to the bank and pull out them Franks</p>
      <p begin="00:38.840" end="00:40.340" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I put on Cologne in the bank (Yeah)</p>
      <p begin="00:40.054" end="00:43.248" ttm:agent="v1">Fifty thousand for the chain on my mother****in' neck, I'm a walkin' saint</p>
      <p begin="00:43.248" end="00:46.855" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Asked her, said she wanna cry in the bucket or come cry in the Bentley, yeah (Which one you really wanna cry in?)</p>
      <p begin="00:46.855" end="00:49.731" ttm:agent="v1">Up in the club and I got my lil' Glock tucked, Fatty got a semi, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:49.731" end="00:51.718" ttm:agent="v1">**** all them niggas, they know it's gon' go up</p>
      <p begin="00:51.718" end="00:54.885" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Niggas gone have to kill me, gotta kill me nigga, yeah, **** you nigga)</p>
      <p begin="00:54.885" end="00:56.385" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:55.122" end="01:02.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Take half a mil' out the bank, put it in this b***h face, she got scared, kinda she ain't ever seen that much money, bet I make her faint (I make her faint)</p>
      <p begin="01:02.400" end="01:05.528" ttm:agent="v1">She told me, &quot;Change the light in the car,&quot; so she can get her a lil' picture</p>
      <p begin="01:05.528" end="01:08.697" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Soon as I bought her Chanel, she ain't wanna go back to her nigga (Ain't wanna go back to that nigga&quot;)</p>
      <p begin="01:08.697" end="01:13.278" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(She like, &quot;**** that nigga, man, that nigga could never do what you do&quot;)</p>
      <p begin="01:13.278" end="01:14.778" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yeah)</p>
      <p begin="01:14.169" end="01:18.782" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yeah, **** that nigga, **** 'em)</p>
      <p begin="01:18.782" end="01:23.194" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Black trucks behind me in traffic (Traffic, yeah)</p>
      <p begin="01:23.194" end="01:26.448" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Snipers on the ****in' roof, I give 'em the green light, he gon' smash it (Woo)</p>
      <p begin="01:26.448" end="01:28.444" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Don't hurt your head, turn backwards (Turn backwards)</p>
      <p begin="01:28.444" end="01:31.053" ttm:agent="v1">Got a lil' b***h and she up in my payroll, workin' that magic</p>
      <p begin="01:31.053" end="01:34.257" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">B***h twice my age (Woo), but she still calling me daddy (Woo)</p>
      <p begin="01:34.257" end="01:35.913" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">In a black truck (Woo), it's a Caddy</p>
      <p begin="01:35.913" end="01:39.036" ttm:agent="v1">Got a lot of these bad b*****s on me shakin' ass, yeah, they get ratchet</p>
      <p begin="01:39.036" end="01:40.627" ttm:agent="v1">I'm off that boop, baby, what's happenin'?</p>
      <p begin="01:40.627" end="01:43.805" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Tell that boy you'll see him later, finna pick you up in the Rolls (Woo, skrrt)</p>
      <p begin="01:43.805" end="01:46.874" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Fast forward through the night, then I had her friend up in the Ghost (Skrrt)</p>
      <p begin="01:46.874" end="01:48.374" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:47.091" end="01:48.591" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Cleanin' my car in the rain (In the rain, nigga)</p>
      <p begin="01:48.572" end="01:51.599" ttm:agent="v1">Nigga can't ask me for shit, you know they ain't hittin' my mother****in' drank</p>
      <p begin="01:51.599" end="01:53.687" ttm:agent="v1">Fifties look like my cup, it's pink, yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:53.687" end="01:55.187" ttm:agent="v1">Go to the bank and pull out them Franks</p>
      <p begin="01:55.097" end="01:56.597" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I put on Cologne in the bank (Yeah)</p>
      <p begin="01:56.372" end="01:59.579" ttm:agent="v1">Fifty thousand for the chain on my mother****in' neck, I'm a walkin' saint</p>
      <p begin="01:59.579" end="02:03.497" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Asked her, said she wanna cry in the bucket or come cry in the Bentley, yeah (Which one you really wanna cry in?)</p>
      <p begin="02:03.497" end="02:06.254" ttm:agent="v1">Up in the club and I got my lil' Glock tucked, Fatty got a semi, yeah</p>
      <p begin="02:06.254" end="02:08.140" ttm:agent="v1">**** all them niggas, they know it's gon' go up</p>
      <p begin="02:08.140" end="02:11.246" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Niggas gone have to kill me, gotta kill me nigga, yeah, **** you nigga)</p>
      <p begin="02:11.246" end="02:19.246" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="02:39.298" end="02:43.172" ttm:agent="v1">I ain't the type of nigga to share my fragrance, yeah</p>
      <p begin="02:43.172" end="02:46.964" ttm:agent="v1">Can't be smellin' the same around these b*****s young nigga, you hear me</p>
      <p begin="02:46.964" end="02:50.084" ttm:agent="v1">My memory clouded up by drugs, sip c*****e 'til I'm dizzy</p>
      <p begin="02:50.084" end="02:53.075" ttm:agent="v1">Park the Maybach on the curb, got these white people like, &quot;He trippin'&quot;</p>
      <p begin="02:53.075" end="02:56.133" ttm:agent="v1">I snaked you but you snaked me first, why it gotta be reptilian</p>
      <p begin="02:56.133" end="02:59.507" ttm:agent="v1">I sip on the purp', not the green, that's yo boyfriend, he chameleon</p>
      <p begin="02:59.507" end="03:02.711" ttm:agent="v1">You gotta know what's going on, I'm not a regular civilian</p>
      <p begin="03:02.711" end="03:05.788" ttm:agent="v1">I told my mom before she was gone that I'd see me a million</p>
      <p begin="03:05.788" end="03:09.244" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, the irony, oh-oh</p>
      <p begin="03:09.244" end="03:12.213" ttm:agent="v1">Better get his b***h 'fore I take her home 'cause she eyein' me, oh</p>
      <p begin="03:12.213" end="03:15.161" ttm:agent="v1">B***h, I ain't stupid, think I'm a trick, I ain't buyin' it, yeah</p>
      <p begin="03:15.161" end="03:18.152" ttm:agent="v1">Sit in the back of the Ghost like I'm possessed</p>
      <p begin="03:18.152" end="03:20.715" ttm:agent="v1">Take her to designer stores, watch her get undressed</p>
      <p begin="03:20.715" end="03:24.715" ttm:agent="v1">Instagram bio say she highly favored and she blessed</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</tt>
